                    <signifLet xml:id="m-d2fd0329-94a8-4f74-8802-35bc13c3571c" /></nc></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-edbdd1f9-25f9-457a-968c-99bfb64b2377">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-aaf46441-1697-4233-8849-535c0b895b55" type="punctum" xml:id="m-88ac9fac-a86e-4e56-965f-9118fc17a3a0">
                  <nc xml:id="m-e3e10e16-2d62-4f79-bfb0-70a2be53af9a" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-23b47aa8-b439-4c41-811e-7e751b6283cb">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e66b3dd7-5306-4ddf-b643-a9ed00b37530" type="punctum" xml:id="m-c58b135f-35db-43bd-ad02-6c1106114fe2">
                  <nc xml:id="m-ae6d9741-f510-4a93-9963-ee87db7fe49c" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-2f064038-94cb-4c30-ab73-c9863ed7db4c">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-35741b48-7ff3-4200-8909-56f8b1eeec3f" type="punctum" xml:id="m-24e11f0b-0dc4-41ac-886c-971de445332f">
                  <nc xml:id="m-3c6ba31f-5868-4182-8553-51e659dc7afd" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-2d48631f-cb9a-4a4d-820e-be8d9d58b61c" facs="#m-f617d22d-4a15-4aa2-8e98-16f0ad306dec" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-7c045aff-8daa-4598-b5b7-6c2c03d902a2"><lg xml:id="m-267ae056-892f-49ef-89bf-7dc9c6951c42"><l xml:id="m-f9e78df3-eb62-4cf9-b0bc-424ca9b86b34" facs="#m-9e47511f-74f4-48c9-963e-de57bc5ee331" label="ambiguous">Psalm 90</l><l xml:id="m-e83fe023-33bc-4b69-bf9f-b0238b10c61a" facs="#m-90db9079-c99a-4d52-98c3-f69d85fac485" label="ambiguous">25"</l><l xml:id="m-fb052877-8a3f-437e-9cfd-a4c154982380" facs="#m-3c13bd1f-db80-4519-994e-f60f0c76064b" label="lyrics-like">8. Esuriéntes implévit bónis, * et divites dimísit inánes.—</l><l xml:id="m-df1e0209-7cfc-4b7e-875c-5b38e7c11992" facs="#m-026a7e6e-cdb8-4273-8743-e9393b6fac88" label="lyrics-like">9. Suscépit Israël, sérvum súum, * recordátus misericórdide súae,</l><l xml:id="m-073bb363-2718-4b06-b19e-8c9b09039362" facs="#m-2775e320-f8ce-4400-b5e5-9746bee43486" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut locútus est ad pá̂tres nóstros, * erga Abraham et sémen éjus</l><l xml:id="m-b25e3195-3822-429b-872e-31c58b542505" facs="#m-906d1aa6-1d77-4ed7-a21b-cf6fa58b6566" label="lyrics-like">in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-3528ca83-fa9f-4d04-85a5-75c93be182e2" facs="#m-9c981150-0706-484c-9912-c1627a553001" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-561faf47-7965-4bfb-ad66-aea4860d58b2" facs="#m-225b75a7-0f98-4016-95c6-5c44a2ebfdcd" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-732eb021-9c89-467d-b170-503a65d68e78" facs="#m-37b99e2f-5df1-45b6-b79f-27eb3cb9c9b8" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-c1d21a56-f6c7-4995-922a-cc30a2d81af5" facs="#m-422a6619-18f3-4da8-bc50-dbd88207cb21" label="text-like">AT COMPLINE</l><l xml:id="m-847b21ec-9889-4eb0-bc1a-cc9da3af21b0" facs="#m-dbd45a92-db09-4908-88ea-0305ab452095" label="ambiguous">Psalm 4</l><l xml:id="m-d73e3ccd-1140-4642-aa3a-8021a878f0aa" facs="#m-be782cde-b708-4532-89ce-e24b2dd7f8f6" label="lyrics-like">1. Cum invocáve-ro, exáudi me, Dé-us justi-ti-ae mé-ae, f qui in tribu¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ccd7dee-6a8d-4f64-a27a-9fa5481f438b" facs="#m-e8b6e811-69ea-462f-9042-ecd5e5fec816" label="lyrics-like">la-ti-ône me sublevá-sti; *mi-seré-re mé-i et exáudi o-ra-ti-ónem</l><l xml:id="m-8f788149-2e0f-4332-8eb6-cd322c5bb73e" facs="#m-a5573ebc-7ee8-400b-891e-2cfd57501d9f" label="lyrics-like">mé- am. — Flex : peccáre, 1</l><l xml:id="m-1f1b0758-d639-43bd-809b-6e9d098a6585" facs="#m-032025bc-b03d-4831-adab-b772b9877231" label="lyrics-like">2. Viri, quoúsque éstis gráves córde?*quáre dilígitis vanitátem et</l><l xml:id="m-f3c9c7bf-966b-4e89-91a8-1deaceb85335" facs="#m-28d18ff2-9b7d-43eb-bc07-7d4afa60c10d" label="lyrics-like">quaéritis mendácium?</l><l xml:id="m-ede1705b-447b-42bc-ba34-acd84765fc37" facs="#m-888cc921-b039-4d6f-b956-56256b0c09d2" label="lyrics-like">3. Scitóte: mirábilem fácit Dóminus sánctum súum; “Dóminus exáudiet</l><l xml:id="m-8aa8778c-89d3-4191-9a85-7b2b3bef3903" facs="#m-98b636cd-cb8d-43ac-b8a7-04445fa0ecbb" label="lyrics-like">me, cum invocávero éum.</l><l xml:id="m-2a9fd50a-9af9-4969-9ec3-afdb6f4f7c35" facs="#m-fa3ec754-0f3e-45af-a5fa-a3dc1b5db0a8" label="lyrics-like">4. Contremiscite et nolite peccáre, f recogitáte in córdibus véstris, * in</l><l xml:id="m-067831fd-c99f-41e7-a1ba-595b9fe48de6" facs="#m-832aac42-8111-4205-989d-718666df3a28" label="lyrics-like">cubilibus véstris, et obmutéscite.</l><l xml:id="m-5e947528-9cac-45d6-b4f7-afe49749ad9a" facs="#m-a9485cad-c50e-49e2-9b99-b55ff794e37a" label="lyrics-like">5. Sacrificáte sacrificia jústa, * et speráte in Dómino. —</l><l xml:id="m-b2ed01fb-0c8e-4aa4-9f5f-aca9f02c4731" facs="#m-265ca7f1-399d-4a6f-a07b-e6986cea6fcb" label="lyrics-like">6. Múlti dicunt: «Quis osténdet nóbis bóna?“Extólle super nos</l><l xml:id="m-4f56db20-f673-4329-a92a-1355143b8268" facs="#m-417b4405-28b1-4e3a-8837-5e217b4a05c1" label="lyrics-like">lúmen vúltus túi, Dómine!</l><l xml:id="m-297fa7c9-d92e-4b47-b447-96e7a1699c74" facs="#m-38859899-bf93-43a3-b1ee-ddadd356303e" label="lyrics-like">7. Dedisti laetitiam in cor méum“majórem, quam cum abúndant</l><l xml:id="m-1dc13838-3443-4e75-a1f7-fd5936477d27" facs="#m-c7400370-40b5-40be-a35e-4dc228bef269" label="ambiguous">tritico et vino.</l><l xml:id="m-b7bda352-0f53-4fec-966a-0b12d862a4a8" facs="#m-6bc0c217-4690-496c-8485-5cc4e44f8f08" label="lyrics-like">8. In páce, simul ac decúbui, obdormisco, f quóniam tu solus, Dómine,"</l><l xml:id="m-70696282-6ab6-4c43-ab9d-4f5ba76f3170" facs="#m-c7e8c46b-1283-4836-80d6-1cf0ca38a591" label="lyrics-like">in securitâte me constituis.</l><l xml:id="m-c2bbe28c-c2f1-4c63-a144-da73c5a45ab3" facs="#m-01cc3862-7358-4ce0-84b9-2853a305d49a" label="lyrics-like">9. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-9ab17b6c-f779-4c54-a3da-63dc40af7aa1" facs="#m-347c647d-fa2b-4ce3-ac59-fb5c504932a5" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-cff50b2c-53ff-49db-94c4-8d411c286bc7" facs="#m-48256042-8f6e-4093-99f9-6966c590439f" label="ambiguous">lorum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-1159a8c3-9c0e-4753-b387-4df500000d32" facs="#m-7f44cda5-7ae2-4522-84cb-dff41578430e" label="ambiguous">Psalm 90</l><l xml:id="m-4b686f9d-faa6-488c-baf9-a91c7c047c41" facs="#m-12c19ebf-1b03-4529-9271-662f592c43e4" label="lyrics-like">1. Qui dégis in praesi-di-o Altissimi, *qui sub úmbra Omnipoténtis</l><l xml:id="m-ea2f7e89-4bdc-4eab-b32b-0c86e1e768c3" facs="#m-0579e46c-9602-4f3c-b80a-502affa952ef" label="lyrics-like">commorá- ris, Flex: próteget te, t</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>